# The splats' pack growth, held to one set of numbers by both packs: the TypeScript reference in
# packages/splats/src/pack.ts and the core's port in crates/null3d-core/src/chunk_rows.rs. Each
# reads this file and fails when its own growth leaves these figures.
#
# Every splat is a unit square at full opacity, so it covers 1 and the whole chunk covers `count`.
# A prefix of n splats covers n, so its growth is the square root of count over n, capped at 3.

count 16
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1
splat 1 1 1 1

# prefix growth: a sixteenth would quadruple and the cap holds it at three, a quarter doubles, and
# the whole chunk draws at its own scales.
expect 1 3
expect 4 2
expect 16 1
